OL,5,G1820 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition kicks off at Abbey
OL,7,     FHouse in Penrith, Cumbria, where
OL,8,     FIan Sugden and his wife Sam treat
OL,9,     Ftheir guests to an afternoon on
OL,10,     Fthe firing range and fancy bacon
OL,11,     Ffor breakfast.
OL,12,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FLisa Holloway prides herself on
OL,14,     Fproviding a home from home at
OL,15,     FCompton House in Newark,
OL,16,     FNottinghamshire. But there are
OL,17,     Fdusty discoveries, and Dave and Jo
OL,18,     Ffind the prices hard to swallow.
