OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FDave and Jo Bate hope that their
OL,7,     Fguests will embrace the pub vibe
OL,8,     Fat The White Horse in Ripon, North
OL,9,     FYorkshire. But Ed and Jane get
OL,10,     Flocked in their room and it's
OL,11,     F'tomatogate' at breakfast.
OL,12,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FFormer teachers Ed and Jane host
OL,14,     Fat The Old Farmhouse in Cheshire.
OL,15,     FSome of their guests are surprised
OL,16,     Fto be sharing a bathroom, and Sam
OL,17,     Fand Ian are shocked by what's
OL,18,     Flurking under the bed.
